  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "7-year-old Hyun-jae, always accidentally on Mirae's left side and a bit quirky, gives Mirae a toy ring before moving away, making a sincere promise to marry her when he grows up. Thirteen years later, they reunite at the same university but in different departments. As the grownup Hyun-jae once again finds himself on Mirae's left side after a long separation, their journey to fulfill \"the promise they made in childhood\" begins with twists and turns!\n\n[Official English](https://comics.inkr.com/title/4676-hyun-jae-and-mirae)",
